images.caption:
The U.S. Navy repair ship USS Jason (AR-8) in port at Naval Station Subic Bay, Philippines, with serveral destroyers alongside, in 1965. The ships are (l-r):
USS Somers (DD-947);
USS Hoel (DDG-13);
USS John R. Craig (DD-885);
USS Perkins (DD-877);
USS Southerland (DD-743).

